<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Venprecar cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Venprecar cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Santander Investment analysts Victoria Santaella and Cesar Villacencio cut their rating for Venezuelan steel producer Venprecar to market perform from buy.</p>
<p>-- The cut reflects &quot;our belief that the company will not benefit significantly from the forecast economic recovery and will suffer from lower (hot briquet iron) prices and the negative effect of an overvalued bolivar,&quot; they wrote in a Feb 19 analysis.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
